        "subtitle": "Gampong Riseh Teungoh - Status Hilang/Hanyut",
        "content": "<div style=\"background: rgba(196, 30, 58, 0.1); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-red); margin-bottom: 2rem;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 3rem;\">\u26d4</span><div><div style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-red);\">STATUS: HILANG / LUMPUH TOTAL</div><div style=\"color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 1rem;\">Prioritas Penanganan: KRITIS</div></div></div></div><div style=\"display: grid; gap: 2rem;\"><div style=\"background: white; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); border-top: 4px solid var(--accent-red);\"><h4 style=\"font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-dark); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.3rem;\">\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Pemerintahan & \ud83c\udfea Ekonomi</h4><div style=\"background: rgba(196, 30, 58, 0.05); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 1rem;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-red);\">Pasar Krueng Haji & Riseh Teungoh</span><span style=\"background: var(--accent-red); color: white; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700;\">HILANG / LUMPUH TOTAL</span></div><div style=\"color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1rem;\"><strong>Keterangan:</strong> Pasar Riseh Teungoh & Kantor Gampong hilang hanyut. Pasar Krueng Haji rusak berat, lumpur tebal; aktivitas pindah ke Masjid.</div><div style=\"font-size: 0.8rem; color: #64748b; border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.1); padding-top: 0.5rem;\">\ud83d\udd0d Verifikasi: Lapangan / R3P</div></div></div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); border-top: 4px solid var(--accent-red);\"><h4 style=\"font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-dark); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.3rem;\">\ud83c\udf09 Infrastruktur & \ud83c\udf3e Pertanian</h4><div style=\"background: rgba(196, 30, 58, 0.05); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 1rem;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-red);\">Jalan, Jembatan & Lahan Sawah</span><span style=\"background: var(--accent-red); color: white; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700;\">HILANG / PUTUS</span></div><div style=\"color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1rem;\"><strong>Keterangan:</strong> Jembatan hilang & jalan putus. Lahan sawah tertutup material batuan/lumpur tebal; bendung irigasi rusak.</div><div style=\"font-size: 0.8rem; color: #64748b; border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.1); padding-top: 0.5rem;\">\ud83d\udd0d Verifikasi: Lapangan / R3P</div></div></div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); border-top: 4px solid var(--accent-amber);\"><h4 style=\"font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-dark); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.3rem;\">\ud83c\udf93 Pendidikan</h4><div style=\"display: grid; gap: 1rem;\"><div style=\"padding: 1rem; background: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.05); border-radius: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--accent-amber);\">\u2022 Kelompok Belajar Semai Benih:</strong> <span style=\"color: var(--text-secondary);\">Rusak Berat</span></div></div></div></div><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-red), #941526); padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 12px; color: white; text-align: center; margin-top: 2rem;\"><div style=\"font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">\u26a0\ufe0f REKOMENDASI URGEN</div><div style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.7; opacity: 0.95;\">Diperlukan <strong>REVISI DATA R3P 2026</strong> dari status \"Rusak Berat\" menjadi <strong>\"HILANG TOTAL\"</strong> untuk alokasi anggaran and program rehabilitasi yang tepat sasaran.</div></div>"
